OL,3,GNEWSAHuntingdon train attacker found
OL,4,Aguilty of all 14 counts of attempted
OL,5,Amurder
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnthony Williams has been found guilty
OL,8,Fof all 14 counts of attempted murder
OL,10,FWilliams, 33, attacked 10 people on an
OL,11,FLNER train from Peterborough to London
OL,12,Fon 1 November last year
OL,14,FHe denied 14 counts of attempted murder
OL,15,Fin total, including attacks away from
OL,16,Fthe train, in Peterborough and London
OL,18,FThe jury initially found Williams
OL,19,Fguilty of seven counts - but had yet to
OL,20,Freach verdicts on the remaining seven
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
